  "description": "New for 2020, the Flightline Plus model has been upgraded to 27.5\" wheels for a smoother riding experience. The updated frame keeps its Boost rear triangle and unique chainstay design, which together create plenty of room for the Kenda Havok 2.8\" or 2.6\" tires. The increase in diameter, width and control will make for even more comfortable and fun all-terrain and all-weather rides, whether it is over sand, rocks or even snow.\nNew Haro FL 27.5\" Plus, 6000 series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nSuntour XCT 30 HLO 27.5\"+/29\" fork w/ 100mm travel\nNew Shimano M315-B2 alloy crankset 36-22T, Boost chainline\nNew Shimano M315 2x8-spd front derailleur\nShimano Tourney TX-800 8-spd rear derailleur\nShimano HG-200 8-spd 12-32t cassette\nXD-155 alloy DW rims, 32mm wide\nPivit alloy cassette 32h hubs, Boost rear\nKenda Booster 27.5\"x2.6\" tires\nAlloy disc brakes w/ 160mm rotors",
